To begin twoweaponing, you must be wielding a one-handed weapon and have 
another one-handed weapon as your alternate weapon. You can do this by:
- 'w'ielding one weapon
- 'x'changing the weapon to your other hand
- 'w'ielding the second weapon
- #twoweapon.
You can't twoweapon if your alternate weapon is an artifact. Sting is 
rubbish, you'd do better using Fire Brand with some other weapon.


